---

# 3. Scope

This document contains examples of:

- Metadata Elements;
- Metadata Schemas;
- Metadata Profiles;
- Metadata Instances;
- Metadata Relationships;
- Metadata Validation;
- Metadata Governance.

The examples are implementation independent.

